Wrapped definition term continuation below the content column strips leading whitespace

```
- one
  :: term
 wrapped
.
<ul>
  <li>one
    <dl>
      <dt>term</dt>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>wrapped</p>
```

```
- one
  :: term
wrapped
.
<ul>
  <li>one
    <dl>
      <dt>term</dt>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>wrapped</p>
```
